---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.ts';

// Describes exactly what the site does today: one contact form, no cookies,
// no analytics. Update it the moment you add analytics, an ad pixel, a chat
// widget, or any third-party embed — all of those change what this must say.
// Not legal advice. Worth twenty minutes of a solicitor's time before launch.
const updated = '29 August 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="What Peak Vending does with the information you send through this website."
>
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>What we do with your details.</h1>
      <p class="legal__meta">Last updated {updated}</p>

      <p class="legal__lede">
        Short version: the only thing this website collects is what you type into
        the contact form, we use it to reply to you, and we do not sell it to
        anybody. The detail is below.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.legalName} is the data controller for this website. Reach us at
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> about anything on this
        page.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>What you send us.</strong> The contact form asks for your name,
        your email address, the business or site you are enquiring about, the
        type of site you select from the list, and anything you write in the
        message box. Nothing is pre-filled and nothing is taken without you
        typing it.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>What the server sees.</strong> Like any website, ours sits behind
        a host that records the IP address and browser of anyone who visits, as
        part of keeping the site up and blocking abuse. We do not use those
        records to identify visitors and we do not combine them with anything
        else.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we collect it, and our lawful basis</h2>
      <p>
        To reply to your enquiry and, if it goes further, to arrange a site visit
        and put a quote to you. Our lawful basis under UK GDPR is legitimate
        interests &mdash; answering someone who has deliberately contacted us
        about our services. We do not add you to a mailing list, and we do not
        use your details for marketing unless you ask us to.
      </p>

      <h2>Who else handles it</h2>
      <p>
        Two companies process data on our instructions, and only on our
        instructions:
      </p>
      <ul class="legal__list">
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts this website and delivers it to your
          browser.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Resend</strong> delivers contact form submissions to our inbox
          as email.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Both are based in the United States, so your enquiry leaves the UK when
        it reaches them. Both operate under transfer safeguards permitted by UK
        data protection law. We do not sell, rent, or share your details with
        anybody else.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no cookies. It runs no analytics, no advertising pixels,
        no session recording, and no third-party embeds. There is nothing here
        to consent to, which is why you have not been asked. If that ever
        changes, this page changes first and you will be asked properly.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiries stay in our email for up to 24 months, so we can pick up a
        conversation that went quiet. After that they are deleted. If you want
        yours deleted sooner, ask and we will do it.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under UK data protection law you can ask us for a copy of what we hold
        about you, ask us to correct it, ask us to delete it, or object to how we
        are using it. Email us and we will deal with it directly &mdash; within a
        month, and usually a lot sooner.
      </p>
      <p>
        We make no automated decisions about you and do no profiling.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you are not happy with how we have handled something, tell us first
        and we will try to sort it. You also have the right to complain to the
        Information Commissioner&rsquo;s Office at
        <a href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a> or on
        0303 123 1113.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal .wrap { max-width: 68ch; }
  .legal h1 { max-width: 16ch; margin-block: var(--sp-2) 0.5rem; }
  .legal__meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .legal__lede {
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
    padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4);
    background: var(--blue-tint);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .legal h2 { font-size: var(--step-3); margin-top: var(--sp-5); margin-bottom: var(--sp-2); }
  .legal p { color: var(--muted); }
  .legal p strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .legal__list { margin: var(--sp-2) 0 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .legal__list li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal__list strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
